                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ef18da86-b902-4ca4-b3df-5820c8f684d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b4c1bb13-d26c-3315-9f49-9f317606109a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5f201f7a-91fe-364d-b4ac-0a603c7b9448",
                        "target_lang_word": "prima donna",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prima donna",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "622553ce-627b-331b-8cde-8291de6c309a",
                                        "entry_id": "83922483-04a4-3724-9f6a-4fd0a4295738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The principal female singer or the leading lady."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec10829-7f87-4dde-9a65-fc4963fa7faf",
                                                "sense_id": "622553ce-627b-331b-8cde-8291de6c309a",
                                                "text": "The truth is, the inhabitants of that languid and luxurious city wanted some little variety; and the minister ... supported a favourite actress in the range of first-rate characters in the Opera—supported her against the united musical opinion of Naples. One night she sang worse than ever; and the next morning half the city rose up, demanding liberty and a new prima donna."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a772ec3-ec7b-3a90-a424-cd299295b4e4",
                                        "entry_id": "83922483-04a4-3724-9f6a-4fd0a4295738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who considers themself much more important than others, has high expectations of others and becomes angry when their demands are not met."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f6b79e0-f17b-4f07-bab8-9a9a625df3af",
                                                "sense_id": "6a772ec3-ec7b-3a90-a424-cd299295b4e4",
                                                "text": "I've had enough of watching scenes / With schizophrenic, egocentric, paranoiac, prima-donnas"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f050277-7e38-4294-8717-fec07fab35ef",
                                                "sense_id": "6a772ec3-ec7b-3a90-a424-cd299295b4e4",
                                                "text": "This year Mata has done more than anyone to give fresh belief that professional football is not only built on greed and staggering wages for its strutting prima donnas. The Manchester United and Spain midfielder, instead, has broken new ground and begun to use football’s power and wealth to help ordinary people around the world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14b1b365-f769-499e-a152-1e9e8ecc68d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "b4c1bb13-d26c-3315-9f49-9f317606109a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5f201f7a-91fe-364d-b4ac-0a603c7b9448",
                        "target_lang_word": "primadona",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be7ae62a-2b35-4d7b-9ea1-d77dfeb573f6",
                        "source_entry_id": "b4c1bb13-d26c-3315-9f49-9f317606109a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5f201f7a-91fe-364d-b4ac-0a603c7b9448",
                        "target_lang_word": "prima donna",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prima donna",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "804698f5-cf28-398e-bc44-0ce4b4d7786b",
                                        "entry_id": "ab75c1ff-4e30-3527-91c1-451375113469",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Première et principale cantatrice d’un opéra."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6909a51c-b6ac-4508-b666-8afd79047961",
                                                "sense_id": "804698f5-cf28-398e-bc44-0ce4b4d7786b",
                                                "text": "Madame Hulot faisait remonter les premières infidélités de son Hector au grand finale de l’Empire. La baronne avait donc tenu, pendant douze ans, dans son ménage, le rôle de prima dona assoluta, sans partage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff788f12-2abf-4206-8342-5cee52e86249",
                                                "sense_id": "804698f5-cf28-398e-bc44-0ce4b4d7786b",
                                                "text": "Constance Bartolozzi, murmura-t-il lentement, prima donna du théâtre de la Princesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5f03e22-19a2-4165-91da-334e3d1e9af5",
                                                "sense_id": "804698f5-cf28-398e-bc44-0ce4b4d7786b",
                                                "text": "Pour l’amour du ciel, pourquoi ces fleurs, je ne suis pas une prima donna !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f20ecec-b970-400f-b9e7-2e5e85f2f301",
                                                "sense_id": "804698f5-cf28-398e-bc44-0ce4b4d7786b",
                                                "text": "Les plus belles femmes du monde, les grandes ballerines, les prime donne, les Rachel, les Duse et les Garbo,-voilà ce à quoi, dans son esprit, j'étais destiné."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40913e82-21e9-4476-912b-cfe4f84f9e37",
                        "source_entry_id": "b4c1bb13-d26c-3315-9f49-9f317606109a",
